#* {{quote-journal|en|author=Brian Lowry|title=‘Let Them All Talk’ takes a breezy boat trip with Meryl Streep and company|magazine=w:CNN|url=https://www.cnn.com/2020/12/10/entertainment/let-them-all-talk-review/index.html|date=2020-12-10|passage=“Let Them All Talk” is as '''breezy''' as an ocean cruise (pre-Covid), and mostly a welcome excuse to enjoy its three septuagenarian leads – Meryl Streep, Candice Bergen and Dianne Wiest – as they banter their way across the Atlantic.}}

